{"id":"vod_sn_52718","vodId":"52718","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"枪械少女","name_cn":"枪械少女","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20231019-1/417a3201df67a537e10f118f7b6362b2.jpg"},"summary":"现国（近藤孝行 配音）是一名平凡的普通青年，某一日，他来到了青锖学园任教，哪知道等待着他的，却是一段他怎么也想象不到的奇遇。原来，在这所学校里就读的学生们，每一个人都是一种枪械的化身，其性格亦反应了对应枪械的特性，在这里，现国会遭遇怎样的故事呢？\r\n　　外表乖巧可爱但到关键时刻就会暴走的芬子（野水伊织 配音）、身材姣好容貌秀丽却说着一口关西话的一六（富樫美铃 配音）、喜欢这芬子的希格（作图元相知 配音）、娇小可爱沉默寡言的艾儿（味里 配音）、有着双重人格的阿玖（古谷静佳 配音），在这些女孩子，或者说是枪械的包围下，现国的日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-19 18:54:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":10,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/TGmhL7xgrM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/Ty6WSzrQ4h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/DCmgbr3kzN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/0w9gDjCvWT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/PeGANr4ZUG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/VuwhZFpxAs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/e3c94NtnAP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/qEszWUDiLG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/pkaPY6Nnk31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/18/c2wk7g3W9c1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:47.581Z"}